OL,3,Vupppppp5CFriday                   G1/5
OL,5,G1830 Home and Away
OL,6,     FRemi gives Sonny an ultimatum.
OL,7,     FBeau pleads his case. David
OL,8,     Fexecutes a search warrant.
OL,9,G1900 GPs: Behind Closed Doors
OL,10,     FIn Birmingham, a valued staff
OL,11,     Fmember is leaving after 42 years
OL,12,     Fin the NHS. Meanwhile, patients in
OL,13,     Fneed of care include a man worried
OL,14,     Fabout persistent bleeding from his
OL,15,     Fback passage.
OL,16,G2000 Casualty 24/7: Every Second Counts
OL,17,     FAfter a quiet start to the day,
OL,18,     Fthe staff at Barnsley casualty
OL,19,     Ftreat John who has hit is head
OL,20,     Ffalling at home and seven month
OL,21,     Fold Elisa is treated in
OL,22,     Fpaediatrics.
OL,23,Vppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
